VERDICT (W5, G8, G5)
==============================================================================================================
  Fresnel-like drag (the river dragged by matter density): excluded -- retrograde orbits could not exist.
  A universal drag is invisible in SPARC and bounded only by counter-rotating tracers: lambda_c <= 0.052 (G8, declared).
  A spin-scaled drag is bounded by the RAR's tightness: median-galaxy lambda_c <= 1.000 (p = 1).
  The only swirl with no new constant (omega = a0/c) is allowed everywhere and invisible (~2e-04 dex).

